              "expr": "{stage=\"$stage\", service=~\"$service\"} |~ `Connection is not available|Lock wait timeout|Deadlock found|Too many connections|OutOfMemoryError|RedisCommandTimeout|\\[(INTERNAL_ERROR|STOMP_INTERNAL_ERROR|WS_RELAY_[A-Z_]+_FAILED|METER_ANALYSIS_[A-Z_]+|AI_ANALYSIS_FAILED|RIDE_[A-Z_]+_FAILED|CARPOOL_[A-Z_]+_FAILED|PUSH_[A-Z_]+_FAILED|NON_PARTICIPANT_SUBSCRIBE)\\]`",
